WEBVTT

00:01:09.361 --> 00:01:13.865
"Mob 2
~Rival~"

00:01:14.533 --> 00:01:16.952
Wait, was there an accident?

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:17.995
What the heck?

00:01:18.203 --> 00:01:20.914
--He's bleeding.
--Whoa, this is bad.

00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:26.837
Oh, God...

00:01:27.713 --> 00:01:28.922
Uh...

00:01:29.131 --> 00:01:35.012
I-I need to call an a-ambulance...

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:36.888
What street is this?

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:38.765
He's not moving...

00:01:38.974 --> 00:01:42.644
D-Dude...

00:01:45.314 --> 00:01:50.736
Wh-What the...? My phone--

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:54.364
H-Hey, bro?

00:02:06.335 --> 00:02:11.840
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:02:12.049 --> 00:02:16.928
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:02:17.971 --> 00:02:20.474
I realized that my youth was grey

00:02:20.682 --> 00:02:23.435
The root of this irritation is unknown

00:02:23.644 --> 00:02:25.937
My brain runs parallel with this emotional train

00:02:26.146 --> 00:02:29.149
Struggling adolescence

00:02:29.358 --> 00:02:31.985
Don't disturb the subconscious mind

00:02:32.194 --> 00:02:34.821
Who's that behind me?

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:38.450
Opposing ideas, distortion

00:02:38.659 --> 00:02:42.079
Purge the sorrow

00:02:42.287 --> 00:02:45.624
So, do what you can now.

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:47.751
My life

00:02:47.959 --> 00:02:48.794
Finally

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:53.048
Break it down!!

00:02:53.256 --> 00:02:55.967
(WANT) desire (YOUNG) and sincerity

00:02:56.176 --> 00:02:58.762
(BURN) they begin to sprout (1) within my chest

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:01.556
(TRANCE) I won't awaken (CHANCE) but I want to

00:03:01.765 --> 00:03:04.518
(STANCE) both sides of the coin
(1) are back-to-back

00:03:04.726 --> 00:03:07.312
Accept me as I am

00:03:07.521 --> 00:03:10.524
Conflicting freedom and relations

00:03:10.732 --> 00:03:12.693
If they can become one

00:03:12.901 --> 00:03:14.319
That smile will be

00:03:14.528 --> 00:03:16.154
One and only "1"

00:03:16.363 --> 00:03:21.743
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:21.952
"Mob Psycho 100 III"

00:03:21.952 --> 00:03:22.953
"Mob Psycho 100 III"
MOB MOB WOW!

00:03:22.953 --> 00:03:23.161
"Mob Psycho 100 III"

00:03:23.161 --> 00:03:24.621
"Mob Psycho 100 III"
One and only "1"

00:03:24.621 --> 00:03:24.830
"Mob Psycho 100 III"

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:27.749
"Mob Psycho 100 "
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:03:27.749 --> 00:03:28.583
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:03:28.792 --> 00:03:31.712
One and only "1"

00:03:36.258 --> 00:03:39.219
Come on, Ly-chan. Hurry.

00:03:39.428 --> 00:03:41.221
Okay.

00:03:55.569 --> 00:03:58.321
Why the hell is there traffic here?

00:03:58.530 --> 00:04:00.949
Hey, we're gonna be late.

00:04:01.158 --> 00:04:02.701
I know--

00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:03.952
Wh-What the--?

00:04:04.161 --> 00:04:05.203
An earthquake?

00:04:05.412 --> 00:04:06.663
I don't know!

00:04:06.872 --> 00:04:07.998
What's happening?

00:04:08.206 --> 00:04:12.002
Hey, my phone's not working.

00:04:13.128 --> 00:04:16.006
Hey, what the hell is this?!

00:04:24.347 --> 00:04:25.557
What's going on?!

00:04:25.766 --> 00:04:26.975
--An earthquake?!
--An explosion?!

00:04:27.184 --> 00:04:28.560
What the hell?

00:04:29.936 --> 00:04:31.897
"Spirits"

00:04:32.063 --> 00:04:36.318
Everyone in the area should follow
evacuation orders immediately.

00:04:36.526 --> 00:04:38.945
Man, this earthquake sucks.

00:04:39.154 --> 00:04:40.155
And it's long, too.

00:04:40.363 --> 00:04:43.950
This says there are accidents and
crashes happening everywhere.

00:04:44.159 --> 00:04:47.871
The cause is unknown. Most of
the major roads in Seasoning City

00:04:47.871 --> 00:04:48.205
