went flying off? MekabuFTW: There's an evacuation order for Seasoning City!" The cause is unknown. Most of the major roads in Seasoning City

00:04:48.205 --> 00:04:48.413
"POC@TIN Soldier: Is Earth falling apart? Takoyaki Shut-in: I want takoyaki. I don't care MyWaifuMyWaifu: Isn't
