00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:52.709
Are apparently backed up
due to restricted access.

00:04:52.918 --> 00:04:55.921
Oh, looks like an evacuation
order's been issued.

00:04:56.129 --> 00:04:59.299
Aw, but Shigeo-kun was
gonna ask that girl out.

00:04:59.508 --> 00:05:02.135
Yeah, that's not happening today.

00:05:09.476 --> 00:05:13.146
Th-The suspect is around 160 centimeters tall...

00:05:13.355 --> 00:05:17.150
Um... and wearing a school uniform
and h-holding a bouquet...

00:05:17.359 --> 00:05:25.450
H-He's advancing... as he destroys
buildings around him...

00:05:25.659 --> 00:05:28.370
Wh-Why...?

00:05:28.578 --> 00:05:31.748
C-Come in!

00:06:12.706 --> 00:06:14.916
Thank goodness, I made it in time.

00:06:23.174 --> 00:06:28.471
I had a hunch you'd be here,
so I flew over at the speed of light.

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:30.557
Pretty cool, huh?

00:06:32.559 --> 00:06:35.896
So you're destroying everything you touch.

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:39.357
I'm not sure what happened,

00:06:39.566 --> 00:06:41.401
but if I'd suffice, I'd be happy to lis--

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:43.528
Wait, seriously?!

00:06:53.121 --> 00:06:54.706
Come on. Calm down.

00:06:54.915 --> 00:06:58.460
Well? I've gotten stronger, too, haven't 1?

00:06:58.668 --> 00:07:02.589
I thought I'd try a bit harder
after observing you.

00:07:02.797 --> 00:07:07.552
Oh, you bought flowers! That's great!

00:07:07.761 --> 00:07:11.431
But it might be a little dangerous
going as you are right now.

00:07:55.976 --> 00:07:58.395
I'm not getting through to him?

00:07:59.729 --> 00:08:01.982
You leave me no choice.

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:03.942
I'm gonna have to restrain you!

00:08:07.028 --> 00:08:08.905
Sorry!

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:18.081
I'm gonna have to keep you restrained
until your powers calm--

00:08:29.467 --> 00:08:31.136
Shit!

00:08:31.344 --> 00:08:33.722
Ultimate Barrier!

00:08:47.944 --> 00:08:50.989
The way you are right now...

00:08:51.197 --> 00:08:53.616
...reminds me of when we first met.

00:08:58.038 --> 00:08:59.748
Kageyama-kun...

00:09:02.667 --> 00:09:06.629
Stop this. You should head home for the day.

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:09.674
It's for your own good.

00:09:23.021 --> 00:09:27.984
Kageyama-kun taught me
something very important...

00:09:36.701 --> 00:09:42.999
How I was the one who was average
for relying on these powers.

00:09:43.208 --> 00:09:47.295
How important it is to accept yourself
without any psychic powers.

00:09:47.504 --> 00:09:52.592
I can tell... that Kageyama-kun
is trying to do just that.

00:09:53.885 --> 00:09:55.845
Kageyama-kun...

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:04.479
...isn't the kind of person
who'd hurt others!

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:28.336
He reacted!

00:10:28.545 --> 00:10:30.421
If I destroy those...

00:10:41.808 --> 00:10:44.185
Say, Kageyama-kun...

00:10:46.771 --> 00:10:51.901
You're not supposed to use your
psychic powers against others, right?

00:11:14.632 --> 00:11:16.634
Something just came flying!

00:11:21.264 --> 00:11:23.808
Hey, what the hell was that sound?!

00:11:25.476 --> 00:11:26.978
Oh, no...

00:11:39.157 --> 00:11:40.950
--Mommy!
--Who the hell is this guy?!

00:11:41.159 --> 00:11:43.494
He's destroying things as he walks?!

00:11:43.703 --> 00:11:45.914
Get away! He's dangerous!

00:11:46.122 --> 00:11:47.790
Another earthquake!

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:57.759
Not here, Kageyama-kun!

00:11:57.967 --> 00:12:01.054
There are people who haven't evacuated yet!

00:12:01.262 --> 00:12:05.016
Kageyama-kun's powers just keep growing...

00:12:05.225 --> 00:12:07.977
What can I do?

00:12:09.437 --> 00:12:13.650
Everyone! It's dangerous here!
Please get to shelter immediately!

00:12:13.858 --> 00:12:16.319
This is the epicenter of the disaster!

00:12:16.527 --> 00:12:18.488
Please just get as far as you can!

00:12:19.656 --> 00:12:21.491
Ly-chan!

00:12:31.876 --> 00:12:36.381
Kageyama-kun, are you having
some kind of episode?

00:12:36.589 --> 00:12:38.216
To think you, of all people,
would go berserk

00:12:38.424 --> 00:12:40.885
and lose control of your powers...

00:12:42.804 --> 00:12:47.350
I guess you're pretty average, too!
I'm a bit relieved, honestly.

00:12:52.522 --> 00:12:53.564
No...

00:12:53.773 --> 00:12:55.900
Wait! There are still people here!

00:13:03.366 --> 00:13:05.076
Help!

00:13:05.285 --> 00:13:07.662
Daddy! Mommy!

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:10.748
--I don't want to die!
--Someone help!

00:13:16.587 --> 00:13:20.466
Mommy! Help me!

00:13:20.675 --> 00:13:23.136
Someone help!

00:13:39.235 --> 00:13:41.195
I know this for sure...

00:13:47.618 --> 00:13:50.288
I've been watching this whole time...

00:13:53.291 --> 00:13:56.961
You're an absolutely gullible softy...

00:13:57.170 --> 00:13:59.922
...but you're still really strong...

00:14:00.131 --> 00:14:02.425
And yet, you...

00:14:06.137 --> 00:14:08.097
Back then...

00:14:08.973 --> 00:14:11.392
...when we first met...

00:14:13.603 --> 00:14:16.272
...you were crying by yourself.

00:14:23.696 --> 00:14:26.532
I'm sure that's the case even now.

00:14:27.784 --> 00:14:31.371
You're crying, aren't you, Kageyama-kun?

00:14:33.373 --> 00:14:34.916
Well?!

00:14:37.293 --> 00:14:40.421
You want someone to stop you!

00:14:44.217 --> 00:14:46.052
Don't you?!

00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:58.648
Kageyama-kun!

00:14:58.856 --> 00:15:01.192
Kageyama-kun!

00:15:01.401 --> 00:15:04.112
Kageyama-kun!

00:15:09.992 --> 00:15:11.869
What...?

00:15:12.078 --> 00:15:14.872
What's going on with me?

00:15:18.876 --> 00:15:20.878
Hanazawa-kun!

00:15:22.296 --> 00:15:27.051
I can tell... that I did this.

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:29.929
I'm the one who did this...

00:15:30.972 --> 00:15:33.266
...to Hanazawa-kun, too...

00:15:35.184 --> 00:15:39.939
He tried everything he could to stop me
until he ended up like this?

00:15:44.527 --> 00:15:47.280
There are times when things
don't work out...

00:15:49.782 --> 00:15:52.285
It's fine if people laugh at you.

00:15:52.493 --> 00:15:55.621
I'm average, too.

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:59.167
That's enough, Hanazawa-kun...

00:16:00.084 --> 00:16:03.421
You don't have to think of this as me.

00:16:04.422 --> 00:16:07.508
I can't stop this thing, either.

00:16:07.717 --> 00:16:10.219
You can fight back!

00:16:10.428 --> 00:16:13.639
Yes! Use your powers against me!

00:16:13.848 --> 00:16:16.726
But don't underestimate me!

00:16:16.934 --> 00:16:18.728
I'm

00:16:21.397 --> 00:16:23.065
I'm

00:16:27.904 --> 00:16:30.364
I'm your...

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:45.004
I'm your rival!

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:54.013
I guess I win this time!

00:17:33.970 --> 00:17:37.431
Seriously, how many times
do I have to tell you?

00:17:37.640 --> 00:17:39.350
Get a clue already, Koyama.

00:17:39.559 --> 00:17:42.895
The items closer to expiry date
go front and center.

00:17:43.104 --> 00:17:45.022
Is it that hard to understand?

00:17:45.231 --> 00:17:46.566
If you don't, the old bentos--

00:17:46.774 --> 00:17:48.317
All right, jeez!

00:17:48.526 --> 00:17:54.115
I'm just trying to get our customers
the best products possible.

00:17:54.323 --> 00:17:58.244
Have you ever witnessed the moment
a chicken pasta salad on display three hours ago

00:17:58.452 --> 00:18:01.330
gets thrown in the trash?

00:18:01.539 --> 00:18:04.500
Nothing in this world is darker than that.

00:18:07.962 --> 00:18:13.050
Well, I can't sell old rice balls
to a customer with a smile.

00:18:13.259 --> 00:18:16.887
Now, listen here. You need to do
as you're told sometimes.

00:18:17.096 --> 00:18:20.308
Did you forget who recommended
you to the manager?

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:21.642
"Koyama"

00:18:21.642 --> 00:18:24.061
"Koyama" I'm grateful for what
the manager has done for me.

00:18:24.061 --> 00:18:24.270
"Koyama"

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:26.063
"Koyama"
And that's exactly why I'm gonna protect...

00:18:26.063 --> 00:18:26.647
And that's exactly why I'm gonna protect...

00:18:26.856 --> 00:18:29.191
...our store.

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:33.154
As I figured, all this destruction
was caused by an esper.

00:18:33.362 --> 00:18:36.699
And he's headed right for
our convenience store.

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:40.703
Hey... That's that one shitty little brat!

00:18:40.911 --> 00:18:41.954
What?!

00:18:42.163 --> 00:18:45.833
I see... it all makes sense now.

00:18:46.042 --> 00:18:48.628
Hey, you little shit!
I have no idea what's going on,

00:18:48.836 --> 00:18:52.048
but I ain't gonna hold back
if you're coming for us!

00:18:53.382 --> 00:18:55.343
Tch. He's not stopping.

00:18:55.551 --> 00:18:57.970
Very well. Then we're going to have to act.

00:19:02.141 --> 00:19:04.560
Telekinetic Helix!

00:19:07.855 --> 00:19:10.274
Jugan: Oden Tongs!

00:19:14.362 --> 00:19:14.528
"Ramen Egg Prefecture
Experiencing Violent Tremors"

00:19:14.528 --> 00:19:17.490
"Ramen Egg Prefecture Experiencing Violent Tremors" --After the incident
at Seasoning Apartments, many other buildings continue to crumble...

00:19:17.490 --> 00:19:19.241
"Ramen Egg Prefecture Experiencing Violent Tremors" --That's not good...
--After the incident at Seasoning Apartments, many other buildings continue to crumble...

00:19:19.241 --> 00:19:19.533
--That's not good...
--After the incident at Seasoning Apartments, many other buildings continue to crumble...

00:19:19.742 --> 00:19:22.578
I should've asked him for his phone number.

00:19:24.872 --> 00:19:27.875
Mob-kun is going to show up, right?

00:19:30.961 --> 00:19:33.089
Hey, look at this.

00:19:33.297 --> 00:19:36.634
This is a picture of the incident
location posted online...

00:19:37.677 --> 00:19:39.637
That's...

00:19:40.721 --> 00:19:42.807
Could that be Psycho Helmet-sama?

00:19:43.015 --> 00:19:45.393
--It must be!
--Wait, but why?

00:19:45.601 --> 00:19:49.230
Captain! Isn't the guy in this picture...

00:19:53.651 --> 00:19:56.195
It really isn't dying down.

00:19:56.404 --> 00:19:58.906
I guess we better comply with
the evacuation orders, too.

00:19:59.115 --> 00:20:00.199
What about Shigeo-kun?

00:20:00.408 --> 00:20:01.784
Whoa, there.

00:20:02.702 --> 00:20:06.122
I can't get through to him.
I think his phone is off.

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:08.624
But we really don't need
to worry about Mob...

00:20:11.961 --> 00:20:13.379
What's wrong?

00:20:13.587 --> 00:20:16.090
Reigen-san. Look.

00:20:22.805 --> 00:20:24.390
Mob?

00:20:27.810 --> 00:20:31.272
Apparently, they've managed to evacuate
everyone including the elderly and children.

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:34.024
We can use as much of
our powers as we'd like.

00:20:34.233 --> 00:20:36.694
Electronics aren't working in the area,

00:20:36.902 --> 00:20:40.072
and the controls for vehicles, such as
cars and helicopters, stopped working.

00:20:40.281 --> 00:20:43.909
So you'll be going down with parachutes.

00:20:44.118 --> 00:20:48.205
If you're able to help with the situation,
they'll consider reducing your sentences,

00:20:48.414 --> 00:20:49.957
so go do your best out there.

00:20:50.166 --> 00:20:52.835
Don't forget that you're being
monitored at all times.

00:20:53.043 --> 00:20:55.546
We're talking about one
measly esper kid, right?

00:20:55.755 --> 00:20:58.758
We've got six. This'll be easy.

00:20:58.966 --> 00:21:01.802
That's just based on eyewitness accounts.

00:21:02.011 --> 00:21:03.012
Yeah, whatever.

00:21:03.220 --> 00:21:06.724
You newbies are gonna have to listen to us.

00:21:06.932 --> 00:21:09.268
Just so you know, we get all the loot--

00:21:10.394 --> 00:21:14.398
I'll go by myself.
The target can't be taken lightly.

00:21:14.607 --> 00:21:18.068
--You bastard! --What the hell'd you do?!
--Kill! Kill! Kill!

00:21:18.277 --> 00:21:22.239
Is the target someone you know?

00:21:22.448 --> 00:21:24.492
I can feel his power...

00:21:25.451 --> 00:21:27.536
...growing even stronger.

00:21:27.745 --> 00:21:29.413
Aw, jeez.

00:21:29.622 --> 00:21:33.542
We should hurry. Open the back.

00:21:33.751 --> 00:21:36.378
Be careful out there, Boss.

00:21:37.463 --> 00:21:38.923
Hatori.

00:21:43.260 --> 00:21:45.596
Hey, where's your parachute?

00:21:55.272 --> 00:21:57.483
There was a blue light shining

00:21:57.691 --> 00:21:59.944
I'm wide awake this 1:30 AM

00:22:00.152 --> 00:22:02.571
What remained even after I swiped

00:22:02.780 --> 00:22:06.408
Are the smiles of my friends right beside me

00:22:15.417 --> 00:22:17.628
Yes, I want someone to understand...

00:22:17.837 --> 00:22:20.172
This wish that's hidden colorless and invisible

00:22:20.381 --> 00:22:22.716
The breath I was holding deep within my heart

00:22:22.925 --> 00:22:25.386
I let it all out at once and return to my senses

00:22:25.594 --> 00:22:27.763
On days that I'm feeling apathetic
it suddenly comes to mind

00:22:27.972 --> 00:22:30.307
These seasons I spent as if they were a given

00:22:30.516 --> 00:22:32.810
Even if reality becomes sullied

00:22:33.018 --> 00:22:36.063
Only the sky we saw together is real

00:22:36.272 --> 00:22:38.190
This is more incomprehensible

00:22:38.399 --> 00:22:40.442
Than the grammar on the blackboard

00:22:40.651 --> 00:22:42.862
If it's going to disappear within 24 hours

00:22:43.070 --> 00:22:45.739
This flowing story is just too lonely

00:22:45.948 --> 00:22:47.658
I just can't do it

00:22:47.867 --> 00:22:49.869
Just like that back hip circle I gave up on

00:22:50.077 --> 00:22:52.371
But I'm not going to...

00:22:52.580 --> 00:22:53.914
Give up

00:22:54.123 --> 00:22:55.708
My present anymore

00:22:55.916 --> 00:22:58.127
I adorn my overflowing emotions

00:22:58.335 --> 00:23:00.671
And run through my worries and hesitations

00:23:00.880 --> 00:23:03.173
It can't be decided from 0 to 100

00:23:03.382 --> 00:23:05.718
Draw the incomplete future with this hand

00:23:05.926 --> 00:23:08.178
We can't even prove its existence

00:23:08.387 --> 00:23:11.348
But as the world stabs the middle of my chest

00:23:11.557 --> 00:23:14.685
It overflows with cobalt blue

00:23:23.235 --> 00:23:24.987
